  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 339e2e83fffa2ad4c95677546a17ffad, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 440560826}
  dialogue:
  - 'heh... hehe... '
  - Hey! are you here to die? just look around you! everything wants to kill you!
  - But I'll help you with some advice before I die in a moment
  - Take everything around! Gather them all!
  - One man's trash, that's another man's come up...
  - Keep drinking water, eating food and medicines by left clicking on the inventory
  - Read the recipe book and craft items unavailable naturally
  - Your minimap will show you the  missions
  - And do not trust the water unless you have a certain honour
  - 'Keep killing and only then you might survive. '
  - Good luck!
